10
00:00:27,919 --> 00:00:28,919
Se

11
00:00:28,919 --> 00:00:31,985
<font color="#FFFFFF">Se eu tivesse escapado desse lugar agora,</font>

12
00:00:31,985 --> 00:00:35,200
